Description: TI Open Source DL/ML runtime modules for Python 3.12
 CPython 3.12 modules for TensorFlow Lite 2.12, ONNX Runtime 1.23 with the
 TIDL execution provider, Apache TVM 0.18, and TIDL Runtime 0.1.
 .
 These modules use TI's PSDK 11.02 CPython 3.12 ABI and are intended for
 Ubuntu Noble on J721E, J721S2, J784S4, J722S, and AM62A-family devices.
